```{=html}
<ul class="list rr-profile-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<li <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>><span class="rr-icon rr-icon-<%- item.icon %>" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><a href="<%= item.url %>"><%- item.name %></a><span class="rr-profile-handle"><%- item.handle %></span></span></li>
<% } %>
</ul>
```
